CAPI=2:
# Copyright 2026 Serge Rabyking
# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH SHL-2.1
# The VLNV carries no package version. It restated one, and by the
# time anyone looked it said 0.1.0 against a package that had
# reached 0.5.0 -- a second copy of a number pyproject.toml owns.
# Everything this project GENERATES already names itself :0.
name: lanserge:revela:gen:0
description: >
  revela as a FuseSoC generator: a pipeline description JSON in, a design
  pack out -- generated Verilog (rendered by np2hw; revela contributes the
  composition and the address allocation), the register map JSON, and the
  same allocation as SystemRDL 2.0. Requires revela on the PATH
  (pip install revela).

generators:
  revela:
    command: revela-fusesoc
    description: >
      Build a revela pipeline into a Verilog core with its register maps.
      Parameters: design (path to the pipeline JSON, relative to the
      calling core, required), control (emit the AXI4-Lite control plane,
      default true).
